<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "A channel has one topic and a welcome nobody reads twice. Everything else — the rules, the link to the event, what was agreed last week — scrolls away and gets retyped. Pinning keeps a message findable."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/pin <message id>")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>message id</code>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "— The number of a message said in this channel.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Easier than the id: right-click the message and choose Pin. The command exists for when you already have the id in front of you. Either way the channel checks again when the pin arrives, and a Pinned button appears in the conversation toolbar as soon as there is something to show."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Who can")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Channel operators and owners — the same bar as the topic, and for the same reason: both are the channel speaking about itself to everybody who walks in. Half-operators moderate the conversation instead."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "A channel keeps up to 50 messages, newest first")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Pinning the same message twice is the same pin")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "A message can only be pinned by the channel it was said in")}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Deleting the message removes the pin with it")}</li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/pin 1284")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-unpin">{dgettext("help_commands", "/unpin")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-pinned-window">{dgettext("help_commands", "Pinned Window")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-topic">{dgettext("help_commands", "/topic")}</.help_link>
</p>
